<span begin="00:55.040" end="00:55.760">background </span><span begin="00:55.760" end="00:56.480">screamin'</span><span begin="00:56.480" end="00:56.480">, </span><span begin="00:56.480" end="00:56.780">"</span><span begin="00:56.780" end="00:57.560">everybody</span><span begin="00:57.560" end="00:57.560">, </span><span begin="00:57.560" end="00:57.950">look </span><span begin="00:57.950" end="00:58.190">at </span><span begin="00:58.190" end="00:58.850">me</span><span begin="00:58.850" end="00:59.270">"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.270" end="01:03.920"><span begin="00:59.270" end="00:59.360">And </span><span begin="00:59.360" end="00:59.450">I'm </span><span begin="00:59.450" end="01:00.230">fading </span><span begin="01:00.230" end="01:00.860">away</span><span begin="01:00.860" end="01:01.070">, </span><span begin="01:01.070" end="01:01.310">you </span><span begin="01:01.310" end="01:01.730">know</span><span begin="01:01.730" end="01:01.730">, </span><span begin="01:01.730" end="01:02.000">I </span><span begin="01:02.000" end="01:02.390">used </span><span begin="01:02.390" end="01:02.480">to </span><span begin="01:02.480" end="01:02.780">be </span><span begin="01:02.780" end="01:03.140">on </span><span begin="01:03.140" end="01:03.920">fire</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.920" end="01:09.230"><span begin="01:03.920" end="01:04.310">And </span><span begin="01:04.310" end="01:04.370">I'm </span><span begin="01:04.370" end="01:05.210">fading </span><span begin="01:05.210" end="01:05.840">away</span><span begin="01:05.840" end="01:06.020">, </span><span begin="01:06.020" end="01:06.200">you </span><span begin="01:06.200" end="01:06.650">know</span><span begin="01:06.650" end="01:06.650">, </span><span begin="01:06.650" end="01:06.950">I </span><span begin="01:06.950" end="01:07.340">used </span><span begin="01:07.340" end="01:07.430">to </span><span begin="01:07.430" end="01:07.790">be </span><span begin="01:07.790" end="01:08.120">on </span><span 